                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Each KPI's achievement: actual ÷ target where higher is better; target ÷ actual where lower is better; 100% when a ceiling KPI is at or below its ceiling; for on-target KPIs, 100% less the distance from the target.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Weighted: the owner's achievements averaged by KPI weight, over the KPIs they own and co-own. Not capped at 100%.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• On-target: the share of those KPIs at or better than target (on-target KPIs count when On track).",
